Suite Setup                         Suite Setup
*** Test Cases ***
Test
    Dated log new line              Test Start
    Run Keyword if                  True==True                             Test SYSLOGS

*** Keywords ***
Test SYSLOGS
    ${syslog}                       SYSLOG Start
    ...                                 host=${GNB_DU.sys[0].M}
    ...                                 name=MyTest
    Sleep                           15
    SYSLOG Stop                     syslog=${syslog}
    ${error}                        SYSLOG Evaluate
    ...                                 syslog=${syslog}
    ...                                 exclusion=5GC001527.My1527.csv
    ...                                 maxRate=10
